# No API key is required for the default local setup (Ollama models).
#
# A key is only needed if you add an openai_compatible endpoint to models.yaml
# that requires one: name its environment variable in the entry's api_key_env
# field, then set it here (copy this file to .env; never commit the real .env).
#
# Example, for an entry with `api_key_env: TF_LLM_API_KEY`:
# TF_LLM_API_KEY=your-key-here
